OL,3,ATwo German airport workers die of
OL,4,Amalaria after 'mosquito arrives on
OL,5,Aplane'
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo Frankfurt Airport workers have died
OL,8,Fof malaria after a rare outbreak led to
OL,9,Fsix employees contracting the serious
OL,10,Finfection spread by mosquitoes.
OL,12,FIt is believed the mosquitoes arrived
OL,13,Fat Germany's busiest airport on a
OL,14,Fplane, according to German public
OL,15,Fhealth officials, triggering an
OL,16,Foutbreak which was first detected in
OL,17,FJuly.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
