OL,3,ATwo German airport workers die of
OL,4,Amalaria after 'mosquito arrives on
OL,5,Aplane'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spokesperson for airport operator
OL,8,FFraport told the BBC an employee had
OL,9,Fdied as a result of the infection,
OL,10,Fwhile public health officials said
OL,11,Flater on Wednesday that two of the
OL,12,Faffected individuals had died.
OL,14,FTraps have been installed at the
OL,15,Fairport and mosquitoes captured will be
OL,16,Fanalysed in a laboratory to determine
OL,17,Ftheir species and origin.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
